Add these to package.json dependencies for call-enabled builds (after installing Android SDK 34):

"@stream-io/react-native-webrtc": "125.4.5",
"@stream-io/video-react-native-sdk": "1.10.14"

And overrides:
"@stream-io/video-react-native-sdk": "1.10.14",
"@stream-io/video-client": "1.4.0",
"@stream-io/video-react-bindings": "1.4.0"

Then: npm install, set compileSdkVersion = 34 in android/build.gradle, gradlew assembleDebug
